zj/thumb/7/71/eykgb0cwyngyso2jch0s3dhqoy36he5.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/71/eykgb0cwyngyso2jch0s3dhqoy36he5.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/71/eykgb0cwyngyso2jch0s3dhqoy36he5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />灾疫呼唤\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">85%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]，施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级属性减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级属性减益</font></span></span>]、强制直行，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；并偷取目标<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]、<font color=\"#58cb48\">3</font>点能量，并施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"霜冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">霜冻</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 4.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/rwdaw38gyb8t5wal6nrmdbshu26p1pg.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f5/rwdaw38gyb8t5wal6nrmdbshu26p1pg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E5%85%BD\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/灾翼兽\"><img alt=\"灾翼兽 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/70/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png/75px-%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E5%85%BD_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcse